### GATE_HTTP — Bitácora ingresos (ODS-235)
### Epic: Ingreso formal + marca UTN + bitácora de accesos
### Endpoints: GET /api/login/admin/audit-recent , GET /api/login/users/{id}/login-history
### Eventos esperados: LOGIN_OK | LOGIN_FALLIDO | LOGOUT (sin telemetría de proyecto)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminEmail = admin@ods.local
@password = Admin1234!

### Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Logout (genera LOGOUT en auditoria_login / sesiones)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Re-login admin tras logout
# @name loginAdmin2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin2.response.body.token}}
@adminUserId = {{loginAdmin2.response.body.user.id}}

### Audit reciente (admin) — usuario, fecha, ip, evento
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/admin/audit-recent?dias=30
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Historial login de un usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/users/{{adminUserId}}/login-history?dias=30
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Login fallido (para dejar LOGIN_FALLIDO en bitácora)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}
